??: Yea you!
????: Shut up both of you! Jeez
Roadie: Who are you?
Harry: I'm Harry. Just a dude that was getting dinner tonight before all this went down.
Angel: C'mon Harry, tell the truth
Devil: Yea, keep lying to him dude
Roadie: Who are they?
Harry: Annoying and Annoying Two
Angel: Honored
