~ clear_robot
Harry: I heard about the robot
Roadie: Nothing conclusive yet, don't keep your hopes up-
Angel: We are cleared right? The robot did it!
Devil: Freedom! We can leave?
Roadie: No. No suspect has been identified
Roadie: Where were you three at 9:10?
Angel: We were eating pizza in the dining room like little angels
: Roadie raises his eyebrow at the angel and looks to the devil
Devil: Would an angel lie? A widdle angel like that one over there?
Angel: =)
Roadie: Yes, actually. Especially that one.
Devil: Well what if this wittle devil told you that I saw Harry go into the office and blow the guy up?
Roadie: I'd say there were no signs of an explosion
Harry: We were in here eating pizza all night, honest.
Roadie: I'll be the judge of that one
Angel: ...
Devil: ...
Harry: Bye
=> END

~ have_pineapple
Devil: Ew dude, pineapple on pizza is stupid
Angel: Disgraceful topping, can't believe you would own such a thing
Roadie: Harry.
Harry: Yea?
Roadie: Have you been in the kitchen tonight?
Harry: Not at all! Why do you ask?
Roadie: I heard you had my job before me and I thought you might know your way around the kitchen
Harry: I did work here before you. Doesn't mean I go snooping around like I own the pizza kitchen though
Roadie: These two stay on your shoulder all the time? They don't wander?
Harry: They vanish sometimes, but they are weird fairy creature things. They do that.
Angel: Guilty as charged on that one your honor
Devil: I prefer the term imp, but yea we do that
Roadie: But they did work with you in that kitchen before, right?
Angel: We did. Never leave his side, remember?
Devil: Yea, loved working in that kitchen. Lots of toys back there!
=> END

~ pineapple_pizza
Devil: We told you pineapple on pizza is stupid
Angel: Why did you bring this to us you moron?
: Harry shoves a slice of pineapple pizza into each of their faces and they stop talking to eat the pizza
Roadie: Whoa! You need to do that more Harry
Harry: They love pineapple on pizza, but they'll heckle anyone who brings it up to them. They are impossible
Harry: I like pineapple on pizza too anyways
Roadie: Is that why they snuck into the kitchen to get the pineapple?
Angel: Yes
Devil: Yea
Angel: HEY WAI-
Devil: Oooh that was sneaky man
Harry: I need to tell you what went down Roadie
Roadie: Alright, spill
Harry: Well, these two wanted pizza, so they convinced me to come in for dinner
Harry: When we got here, we ordered our pizza and sat down
Harry: But, they vanished after I sat down. A little while later I saw them running towards the office so I followed them
Roadie: Ok...
Harry: They don't actually vanish, they can leave, they just won't leave me alone
Devil: No, we are bound to you, remeber?
Harry: No, actually-
Roadie: Continue.
Harry: I followed them into the office and saw them working together to stab Mr. Pepperoncini in his chair. Caused a whole mess
Harry: They blackmailed me and said they would get me in trouble in the afterlife
Angel: We still can~
Harry: Plus, I have to live with these two. You'd understand if you were in my shoes.
Devil: ;)
Harry: But, these two are definitively the cause of the stabbing. They took a knife from the kitchen.
Angel: We loved working here
Devil: So much fun~
Angel: But then Harry got fired
Devil: Which is dumb
Angel: We had to do something about it, look at the poor guy
Devil: Look at poor us!
Angel: You can't lock us up, we are immaterial
: Harry looks at the angel, slowly brings his hand up, and flicks her in the back of the head
Angel: OW!
Harry: I'm starting to wonder if you really are divine beings of morality liek you've sold to me
Roadie: You never thought to try to flick one of them?
Harry: They've never committed murder until now
Roadie: I'm gonna have to figure out what to do with you three, just don't go anywhere until I can verify, the cops are still here
Harry: ...
Angel: Get us another pizza servant!
Devil: Yea, this time without pineapple!
Roadie: I should talk to the detective about this, this is big news!
=> END

